    "finalPromptText": "I'm writing a paper for my sci-fi literature class on Andy Weir's Project Hail Mary. I need a solid overview of the book's major themes — things like isolation, scientific problem-solving, interspecies cooperation — along with how it was received by critics when it came out in 2021. Can you also find out whether Weir has talked in interviews about what inspired the story?",
